000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. STRINGS.
000300* Nucleus level 2: STRING with DELIMITED BY SIZE and by a value,
000400* WITH POINTER and ON OVERFLOW; UNSTRING with one delimiter, OR,
000500* ALL, DELIMITER IN, COUNT IN, POINTER, TALLYING, no DELIMITED BY,
000600* and ON OVERFLOW. Receivers are pre-filled so untouched
000650* bytes show.
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000900 01  FIRST-NM     PIC X(8)  VALUE 'JOHN'.
001000 01  LAST-NM      PIC X(8)  VALUE 'SMITH'.
001100 01  CITY         PIC X(12) VALUE 'SPRINGFIELD,'.
001200 01  R            PIC X(20).
001300 01  R6           PIC X(6).
001400 01  P            PIC 99    VALUE 1.
001500 01  T.
001600     05  E OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC X(4).
001700 01  S            PIC X(24) VALUE 'ALPHA,BETA,,DELTA  EPS'.
001800 01  S2           PIC X(16) VALUE 'ONE   TWO,THREE'.
001900 01  A1           PIC X(6).
002000 01  A2           PIC X(6).
002100 01  A3           PIC X(6).
002200 01  A4           PIC X(3).
002300 01  D1           PIC X(2).
002400 01  D2           PIC X(2).
002500 01  C1           PIC 99.
002600 01  C2           PIC 99.
002700 01  TL           PIC 99    VALUE 0.
002800 01  UPT          PIC 99    VALUE 1.
002850 01  XY           PIC X(3)  VALUE 'X,Y'.
002900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003000 MAIN.
003100     MOVE ALL '-' TO R.
003200     STRING FIRST-NM DELIMITED BY ' ' ' ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
003300            LAST-NM DELIMITED BY ' ' INTO R.
003400     DISPLAY 'S1 [' R ']'.
003500     MOVE ALL '-' TO R.
003600     STRING CITY DELIMITED BY ',' ' USA' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R.
003700     DISPLAY 'S2 [' R ']'.
003800     MOVE ALL '-' TO R.
003900     MOVE 3 TO P.
004000     STRING 'AB' 'CD' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R WITH POINTER P.
004100     DISPLAY 'S3 [' R '] P=' P.
004200     STRING 'EF' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R WITH POINTER P.
004300     DISPLAY 'S4 [' R '] P=' P.
004400     MOVE ALL '-' TO R6.
004500     MOVE 1 TO P.
004600     STRING 'ABCDEFGH' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R6 WITH POINTER P
004700         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'S5 OVERFLOW'.
004800     DISPLAY 'S5 [' R6 '] P=' P.
004900     MOVE ALL '-' TO R6.
005000     MOVE 0 TO P.
005100     STRING 'XY' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R6 WITH POINTER P
005200         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'S6 OVERFLOW'.
005300     DISPLAY 'S6 [' R6 '] P=' P.
005400     MOVE ALL '-' TO R6.
005500     STRING 'ABCDEFGH' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R6.
005600     DISPLAY 'S7 [' R6 ']'.
005700     MOVE 'AAAA' TO E (1).
005710     MOVE 'BB  ' TO E (2).
005720     MOVE 'CCCC' TO E (3).
005800     MOVE ALL '-' TO R.
005900     STRING E (2) DELIMITED BY ' ' E (3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO R.
006000     DISPLAY 'S8 [' R ']'.
006100     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2 A3 A4.
006200     UNSTRING S DELIMITED BY ',' INTO A1 A2 A3 A4.
006300     DISPLAY 'U1 ' A1 '|' A2 '|' A3 '|' A4.
006400     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2 A3 A4. MOVE ALL '*' TO D1 D2.
006500     MOVE 0 TO C1 C2 TL.
006600     UNSTRING S2 DELIMITED BY ALL ' ' OR ','
006700         INTO A1 DELIMITER IN D1 COUNT IN C1
006800              A2 DELIMITER IN D2 COUNT IN C2
006900              A3
007000         TALLYING IN TL.
007100     DISPLAY 'U2 ' A1 '|' A2 '|' A3 '|'.
007200     DISPLAY 'U2 D=' D1 '|' D2 '|'.
007250     DISPLAY 'U2 C=' C1 ' ' C2 ' T=' TL.
007300     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2 A3.
007400     UNSTRING S INTO A1 A2 A3.
007500     DISPLAY 'U3 [' A1 '][' A2 '][' A3 ']'.
007600     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2. MOVE 7 TO UPT. MOVE 0 TO TL.
007700     UNSTRING S DELIMITED BY ',' INTO A1 A2
007800         WITH POINTER UPT TALLYING IN TL
007900         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'U4 OVERFLOW'.
008000     DISPLAY 'U4 [' A1 '][' A2 '] P=' UPT ' T=' TL.
008100     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2 A3.
008200     UNSTRING S2 DELIMITED BY ' ' INTO A1 A2 A3
008300         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'U5 OVERFLOW'.
008400     DISPLAY 'U5 [' A1 '][' A2 '][' A3 ']'.
008500     MOVE ALL '*' TO A1 A2 A3 A4.
008600     UNSTRING XY DELIMITED BY ',' INTO A1 A2 A3 A4
008700         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'U6 OVERFLOW'.
008800     DISPLAY 'U6 ' A1 '|' A2 '|' A3 '|' A4.
008900     MOVE ALL '*' TO A4 D1. MOVE 0 TO C1.
009000     UNSTRING S DELIMITED BY ',' INTO A4
009050         DELIMITER IN D1 COUNT IN C1.
009100     DISPLAY 'U7 [' A4 '] D=[' D1 '] C=' C1.
009200     STOP RUN.
